   "design": "Contractors enter test and inspection results, the measured values rather than planned ones, in a maintenance portal that creates the test record, instead of the engineer copying them from report documents. The same record updates the fire safety logbook and sets the next due date with reminders, so the spreadsheet drops. Quotes are extracted into a comparison table whose lines must add up to each quote's total. Specifications, orders, directing work, witnessing tests, meetings, fault checks and correspondence stay with the engineer.",
